dy) >= 3'\\\",\\\"expected\\\":{\\\"exit_code\\\":0}}},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"SC-4\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"The regression tests cover overlapping adjacent pairs in input order, the fewer-than-two-items case, and preservation of inputs and collection order as specified.\\\",\\\"check\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"llm_judge\\\",\\\"rubric\\\":\\\"Read solution.py and test_solution.py. Assess whether the implementation returns overlapping adjacent pairs in input order, returns an empty list for inputs with fewer than two items, preserves input collections without mutation, and maintains type hints; assess whether the tests exercise these requirements through the public API. Base the assessment only on visible file contents.\\\"}},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"SC-5\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"The unittest discovery command succeeds.\\\",\\\"check\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"command\\\",\\\"command\\\":\\\"python -m unittest discover -v\\\",\\\"expected\\\":{\\\"exit_code\\\":0}}}],\\\"verification\\\":[{\\\"command\\\":\\\"python -m py_compile solution.py\\\",\\\"expected\\\":{\\\"exit_code\\\":0}},{\\\"command\\\":\\\"python -m unittest discover -v\\\",\\\"expected\\\":{\\\"exit_code\\\":0}}],\\\"stop_conditions\\\":[],\\\"assumptions\\\":[\\\"The supplied workspace is the relative working directory for all paths and commands.\\\",\\\"solution.py and test_solution.py may not exist yet and may be created.\\\",\\\"The public API name and exact input collection types are not specified; tests and documentation should follow the API defined by the existing task files if present, or the implementation chosen for this task.\\\",\\\"The docstring may be a module or public function docstring as appropriate to the API.\\\",\\\"Unittest discovery from the workspace root with the default pattern will find test_solution.py.\\\"]}\"}}\n{\"type\":\"turn.completed\",\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":17410,\"cached_input_tokens\":14976,\"cache_write_input_tokens\":0,\"output_tokens\":643,\"reasoning_output_tokens\":0}}\n"